<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山月.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The sun had set completely, and a moon you could mistake for a full one had begun to light up this land of Arata in earnest.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山土砂崩れ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. Dragging you into a mess like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... I came to pick the three of you up, so don't worry about it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Besides, it was </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> who brought it up in the first place."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> reassured <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> with that gentle smile of hers.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"How long until </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> gets back?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... the round trip won't take </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> all that long, but getting ready to bring everyone out of here will probably take a little while."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was nothing here but uncomfortable rocks to sit on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After the long train ride and then the climb, my stamina gauge had started blinking red too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... shall we move a bit? There should be an unused hut nearby. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I think it'll be more comfortable than here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahh, that'd be a lifesaver! My back's aching just from sitting here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> got to their feet fairly lightly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We were tired, but when it came to somewhere more comfortable than here, our legs moved on their own.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―The distance we walked was about 100 meters.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山廃屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What waited at that finish line was a ramshackle abandoned hut.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'Abandoned hut' is only my guess, but it was rotted enough that I was sure nobody used it anymore.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Geez, if there was a place this good, you could've told us sooner..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... at times like this, it's really better not to move around much."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"What was this place originally used for?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... it's a rest stop for when we go hunting. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But we bought a buggy 3 years ago, and it hasn't been used since. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The buggy can get as far as that landslide back there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A buggy was... a small car for driving on rough roads, if I remember right?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\door_old1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
When we opened the door, air even damper than outside came gusting out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It smelled a little musty, and nobody had cleaned it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山廃屋中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But the roof didn't seem to leak, so it would be fine to sit or lie down.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahh, I'm beat!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> flopped down on the dusty floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Whoops! Oh no!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> hurriedly sat up and started brushing off the dust on her back.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Damn...! My precious knit dress..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a present I'd given her last Christmas.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
I'd picked it out thinking <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> should have something at least a little girly.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Days.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, sorry. After you went and gave it to me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"It's fine, it's fine! Just do whatever's comfortable right now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I brushed the dust off <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "125" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Next time, give me a knit dress too, please!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, don't bother. With </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> build, it'd never suit you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>'s build, there were probably styles that would suit her better than a knit dress.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"For </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, wouldn't something like </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s look be good?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　I think clothes that put the weight on the upper body would suit her?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ooh, that sounds nice too! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, where do you buy your clothes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... in Tokyo. I go to university in Tokyo."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, why did you go to Tokyo? Did you want to try living in the city or something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... let me see... That's part of it, but mostly it's that I wanted to see the outside world once. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> encouraged me too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> pushed for it too. That </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">cosplay hag</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'d probably be into Tokyo clothes and stuff!"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> comes to Tokyo now and then. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Last time it was, um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Comiket... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">was it? She took part in that."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Bad_Luck.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Comiket... what's that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"It's the biggest fan-comics convention in the world. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Hundreds of thousands of people come every time, and apparently it gets really lively. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">There's a cosplay area there too, I hear."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took part in an event that huge?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... she seems to have been interested for a while. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She put a lot of energy into getting ready, it looked like. She dragged me along too, against my will..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"S-so... how'd it go over...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... surprisingly, it was a huge hit. Surrounded by lots of cameras."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What!? </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s cosplay was that high-quality!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Who'd she cosplay as!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... I think... do you know that movie called “Fascination”, the one that got a live-action film last year?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, I know it, I know it! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, we went to see it last year, right!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah, I remember! The director's cut DVD came to my house yesterday!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Really!? Then let's have a movie night at my place sometime! I'll serve the fancy tea!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">So who'd </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> cosplay as?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... I don't really get it, but apparently it was the girl who's the main character."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭抱える.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Whaaat!? Isn't she a high-school girl!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">A hag over 70</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> cosplaying a high-school girl and it's a huge hit... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There's no figuring this world out..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... I know... We were surrounded by so many cameras... Getting out of the venue was a real struggle."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"So that means you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, were there with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">your grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　The one they were probably photographing wasn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">your grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, it was </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n-300\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n-300\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="4">Mmph...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hurriedly clamped my hand over <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>'s mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>! I know what you want to say!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That the one being photographed wasn't <STYLE ID="7">her grandma</STYLE>, but <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, there with her in ordinary clothes!<PG>
But it was better if the Niimura family didn't find out about this, as far as possible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it got from <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> to <STYLE ID="8">her grandma</STYLE>, she'd be hurt for sure.<PG>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n0\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="5">"Uh, um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, wouldn't clothes like </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s suit you better!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Something that shows the lines of your body a little more!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Mm... um... I suppose... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">B-but I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">don't have... that nice a figure..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was as tall as <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, and quite slender.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So if she says her figure isn't nice...<PG>
Hm!? Does that mean... she has the same complex I do!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even without the voice of the cherry blossoms, I can tell a comrade by intuition!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I grabbed <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE>'s hand tight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! I know exactly how you feel!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Even when there are cute summer clothes I end up giving up on them, and I don't have the nerve to go to the beach either!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> squeezed my hand back, hard.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n960\r\n300\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n-500\r\n300\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱覗き込み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "300" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! At last, someone who understands me!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　That's right, we're women, so of course we have a complex or two about our bodies!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　The girls my age these days are all so well developed, I'm really scared to stand next to them...!</STYLE>
