<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... so, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I haven't told you yet, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm going to study abroad starting this summer."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Study abroad! That's awesome!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Um... how long'll you be gone?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... 4 years. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So... once the thirteenth-year memorial service is over, we won't see each other for a while..." [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Is that right... We already live apart, but it's still gonna be lonely..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! I'll come see you in any country! Our friendship will last forever and never die!"</STYLE><PG>
