{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'll be waiting!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I'll make lots of friends in Sweden and wait for you to come, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
