{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... that's right. I want to study welfare. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Um, see, this settlement has lots of people much older than me. It's for the settlement's future."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
