<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Ah, I see! Sweden's known as the welfare country, and tuition's free for international students too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s going to be sad. They seem like such close sisters.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">This is my last chance... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Before I go abroad, there's something I have to..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
