<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you mean..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> seems to be planning to tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others too. About </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE><PG>
