―In the darkness, we heard about the curse-killings from <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had to do―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was to stop the curse-killings, and at the same time catch the culprit who killed <STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
