{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"This is the first I've ever heard of any curse-killings, too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Come to think of it, I did feel like fewer people came to the memorial service every year... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But you can't check everyone's face at the memorial service..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Can't check their faces?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, yeah, you wear a Noh mask at the memorial service. Of course you can't tell, right?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Are we wearing Noh masks tomorrow too? That's a pretty unusual custom..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, wearing Noh masks at memorial services is only an Arata thing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What!? Seriously!? I had no idea... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If I'd gone to somebody else's funeral without knowing, I'd have totally embarrassed myself..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"A funeral where only </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s wearing a Noh mask would make a pretty surreal picture."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Total chunibyo..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"That aside, the culprit behind the curse-killings and the culprit who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> aren't necessarily the same, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> looked raring to start deducing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'd left her notepad with <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, so for once she was reasoning without notes.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I understand what's happened over these 10 years, but were there no incidents or anything before that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... if there's anything I can think of... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">over the last 50 years, suicides suddenly started increasing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But sorry... going by memory alone it's fuzzy, so I can't say anything for sure."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hmm, then let's set the suicides aside for now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If anything's unclear about the incidents of these 10 years, we can think about the suicides afterward."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"So, what kind of incidents were these curse-killings? The weapon, how they were killed, all that's known, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... it seems they were all killed with a single blow. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It went straight for the </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="けいどうみゃく">carotid artery</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, so it was the work of someone very practiced."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Is that something you heard recently?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... no. I'd heard it since the incidents first happened."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s death, if you think about it normally, was suicide, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I see, I see... There's something a little strange here."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... really!? What is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
